LanguageData.VGE_TributeDemandHover:
A salvager station is demanding a tribute of {0} silver or it will open fire.

Time until tribute needs to be paid: {1}

You can ask them to postpone the payment, but the Hellion engine will be locked remotely until the tribute is paid or the station is defeated. You can also pay the fee immediately if you have the funds. Running away will likely cause the salvagers to send a search party after you.

LanguageData.VGE_IncomingEnemyGravshipDesc:
An enemy Hellion is approaching fast.

Time until arrival: {0}

You will not be able to escape before it arrives. Prepare for it to fire a volley at you and escape as soon as you can.
